hadiths[31]{hadithnumber,text}:
"690","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the people of knowledge did not disapprove of people fasting using tooth-sticks at any hour of the day in Ramadan"
"691","Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Shihab from Amra bint Abd ar-Rahman that when A'isha was doing itikaf she would only ask after sick people if she was walking and not if she was standing still. Malik said"
"692","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had asked Ibn Shihab whether someone doing itikaf could go into a house to relieve himself"
"693","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad and Nafi"
"696","Malik was asked whether someone who went into a mosque to do itikaf for the last ten days of Ramadan and stayed there for a day or two but then became ill and left the mosque"
"697","Malik said"
"698","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"
"699","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"700","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Abu'n Nadr"
"701","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Humayd at-Tawil that 'Anas ibn Malik said"
"702","Ziyad related to me from Malik from Nafi from Ibn 'Umar that some of the companions of the Messenger of Allah"
"703","Ziyad related to me from Malik that he had heard a man he trusted of the people of knowledge say"
"704","Ziyad related to me from Malik that he had heard that Said ibn al-Musayyab used to say"
"717","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Sa'id that he heard Said ibn al Musayyab say"
"718","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said that al-Qasim ibn Muhammad said that al-Furafisa ibn Umayr al-Hanafi saw Uthman ibn Affan at al-Arj"
"719","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say that a man in ihram should not veil anything above his chin"
"720","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar shrouded his son Waqid ibn Abdullah"
"721","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar used to say that a woman in ihram should wear neither a veil nor gloves"
"722","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa that Fatima bint al-Mundhir said"
"723","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abd ar-Rahman ibn al-Qasim from his father that A'isha"
"724","Yahya related to me from Malik from Humayd ibn Qays from Ata ibn Rabah that a bedouin came to the Messenger of Allah"
"725","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Aslam"
"726","Yahya related to me from Malik from as-Salt ibn Zubayd from more than one of his family that Umar ibn al-Khattab discovered the smell of perfume while he was at ash-Shajara. Kathir ibn as-Salt was at his side"
"727","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said and 'Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr and Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that al-Walid ibn Abd al- Malik asked Salim ibn Abdullah and Kharija ibn Zayd ibn Thabit if he could use perfume after he had stoned the jamra and shaved his head"
"728","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi from Abdullah ibn Umar that the Messenger of Allah"
"729","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Dinar that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"730","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar once entered ihram at al-Fur"
"731","Yahya related to me from Malik from a reliable source that Abdullah ibn Umar once entered ihram at Ilya (Jerusalem)"
"732","Yahya related to me from Malik that he had heard that the Messenger of Allah"
"733","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Umar that the talbiya of the Messenger of Allah"
"734","Yahya related to me from Malik from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah"